it/b456344366ac5dcc495f6bce542587d47f443cb9","commit_subject":"feat(skills): configure the passive power-ups of master skills","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"neomjs/neo","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T18:12:50Z","branch":"dev","commit_sha":"42b80fee8102664f9e9fc1d19373efabf0aa00f9","github_link":"https://github.com/neomjs/neo/commit/42b80fee8102664f9e9fc1d19373efabf0aa00f9","commit_subject":"docs(adr): ADR-0034 §2.3 item 10 names the first-run setup broker's six capabilities and main's credential custody (#19366) (#19367)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"MatterHackers/agg-sharp","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T18:12:49Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"f2c4fae9be680d93ce73d4616676d535f614ff24","github_link":"https://github.com/MatterHackers/agg-sharp/commit/f2c4fae9be680d93ce73d4616676d535f614ff24","commit_subject":"SVG icons draw with LCD subpixel edges, like text: StaticDataBase.RenderSvg attaches an LcdCoverageSidecar (per-channel coverage from a 3x-wide render through the LCD filter, plus the load-time alpha) to the icon's ImageBuffer, and ImageGraphics2D, Graphics2DGpu and LcdBufferGraphics2D composite it through CompositeLcdBuffer when the icon lands 1:1 on whole pixels on a destination that can take it (LcdImageComposite.TryRender). Colour is read from the image at draw time, so theme inversion, GrayToColor and AjustAlpha fades keep the LCD edges. Every other draw - scaled, rotated, fractional, LCD off, a straight transparent target, or an image edited past its load-time alpha - is the plain blit, byte for byte. Geometry changes (scale, mirror, Allocate, Attach, partial CopyFrom) drop the sidecar. Graphics2DGpu's AffineToMatrix moves to GpuAffineMatrix.cs and its frozen limit is lowered to 1159 (new SvgIconLcdTests)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ClickHouse/ClickHouse","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-02T18:12:22Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"4295eb2cab583f4b5bc7d51b738092e2bd8f2cc7","github_link":"https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickHouse/commit/4295eb2c